  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0.6: the sink keeps out only the package's own diagnostics (SourceContext BugsRadar.Client); events from your own BugsRadar.* namespaces, dropped before, are reported now. Requires BugsRadar 3.0.0.6, which fixes the ILogger provider and the casing of property names; see its release notes. 3.0.0.5: no code changes; the author of the package is now BistriySpzoo, the same as the owner on nuget.org. 3.0.0.4: no code changes; the README and the package links point to the new documentation pages at bugsradar.com. 3.0.0.3: the Serilog sink moved here from the BugsRadar package, which no longer depends on Serilog. WriteTo.BugsRadar and the namespace BugsRadar.Extensions.Serilog are unchanged: add this package and the code stays as it is.",
